look material
# NOTE: click on layer surfaces may not register in the harness
ipc panels open spotlight IRICE-TEST
wait 1
key fi
wait 1
shot sr-fi
note Group with 3+ app rows: first row top corners 20, middle rows 4, last row bottom corners 20; 2 px gaps. Row order is Bulk Rename, Thunar Preferences, Calculator, Foot Client in QML (ties by name now).
rec sp-row-sel 0.6 key -k Down
note New selected row's corners round in about 0.22 s with a slight overshoot, the old one returns; compare to QML within 1 frame (133 ms both earlier).
wait 1
ptr move 960 540 sleep 100 glide 960 400 200
wait 1
shot sr-hover
note Unselected row under the pointer: 8 percent layer.
rec sr-press 0.3 ptr move 960 400 down
note Pressed row shows 10 percent layer.
ptr move 960 400 up
wait 1
# MANUAL: /.bash file rows: eye on hover/selection; the title does not shift when it appears (no files in sandbox)
key -k Escape
